{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/41ef1764d1df6ad5b2883e5d64939aa3.poster.avif?t=1759187623\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/41ef1764d1df6ad5b2883e5d64939aa3.webm?t=1759187623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/41ef1764d1df6ad5b2883e5d64939aa3.mp4?t=1759187623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Featuring art and animation from artists who worked on Cuphead and Rick &amp; Morty!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Croak is a 2D precision platformer set in a fractured fairytale. Traverse biomes by grappling and bouncing off surfaces with your frog tongue to overcome challenges and tackle boss fights!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embody a surprisingly agile fat frog, on a journey towards the castle, <i>hopping</i> to free the kingdom from its curse.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of your sharp reflexes and strategic thinking to travel through diverse biomes like swamps, dark undergrounds, and snowy mountains, each with its own interactive twist.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/a4a1895d0ae2ae4fdc59ce646c04dc95.poster.avif?t=1759187623\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/a4a1895d0ae2ae4fdc59ce646c04dc95.webm?t=1759187623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/a4a1895d0ae2ae4fdc59ce646c04dc95.mp4?t=1759187623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER YOUR TONGUE-GRAPPLE ABILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's just you and your trusty tongue VS the world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ability controlled by a single button: grapple yourself onto various platforms, or hold the same button to bounce off, pinball-style! A deceptively simple move to learn, but one that takes real skill to fully master.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/5c286658b0c9e0218aa00b6a486819c8.poster.avif?t=1759187623\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/5c286658b0c9e0218aa00b6a486819c8.webm?t=1759187623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/5c286658b0c9e0218aa00b6a486819c8.mp4?t=1759187623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER ALL THE KINGDOM HAS TO OFFER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secret levels, test your skills in a variety of witty boss encounters, gather collectibles, push your limits in optional high-difficulty challenges.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/57a2ab2324cc79a5e5929844d942b842.avif?t=1759187623\" width=800 height=225 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully hand-drawn and animated using traditional animation\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standout Boss encounters\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of polished levels\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional expert levels for hardcore players\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frog\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2616540?t=1759187623","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2616540?t=1759187623","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/226d35a4edf185b68b8c685a92400810de7c0eb5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759187623","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/226d35a4edf185b68b8c685a92400810de7c0eb5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759187623","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/41ef1764d1df6ad5b2883e5d64939aa3.poster.avif?t=1759187623\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/41ef1764d1df6ad5b2883e5d64939aa3.webm?t=1759187623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/41ef1764d1df6ad5b2883e5d64939aa3.mp4?t=1759187623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Featuring art and animation from artists who worked on Cuphead and Rick &amp; Morty!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Croak is a 2D precision platformer set in a fractured fairytale. Traverse biomes by grappling and bouncing off surfaces with your frog tongue to overcome challenges and tackle boss fights!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embody a surprisingly agile fat frog, on a journey towards the castle, <i>hopping</i> to free the kingdom from its curse.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of your sharp reflexes and strategic thinking to travel through diverse biomes like swamps, dark undergrounds, and snowy mountains, each with its own interactive twist.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/a4a1895d0ae2ae4fdc59ce646c04dc95.poster.avif?t=1759187623\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/a4a1895d0ae2ae4fdc59ce646c04dc95.webm?t=1759187623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/a4a1895d0ae2ae4fdc59ce646c04dc95.mp4?t=1759187623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER YOUR TONGUE-GRAPPLE ABILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's just you and your trusty tongue VS the world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ability controlled by a single button: grapple yourself onto various platforms, or hold the same button to bounce off, pinball-style! A deceptively simple move to learn, but one that takes real skill to fully master.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/5c286658b0c9e0218aa00b6a486819c8.poster.avif?t=1759187623\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.